                <p>No prior sewing experience is required—just bring your curiosity and creativity! You’ll learn how to thread and operate a sewing machine, understand fabric types, cut from a simple pattern, and finish your bag with neat seams and straps. Along the way, you'll also pick up essential sewing vocabulary and techniques that will set you up for future projects.</p>
                <p>This is more than just a class—it’s a confidence boost and a creative kickstart in a supportive, fun atmosphere. Walk in as a beginner, and walk out with a finished bag and new skills that you can build on.</p>
