                        <li>1 to 2 small wooden items or scrap pieces you’d like to work on (e.g., small table, box, shelf, or raw timber)</li>
                        <li>Closed-toe shoes and hair ties (mandatory for shop safety)</li>
                        <li>Any custom hardware or special stains/paints you’d like to add (optional)</li>
                    </ul>
